Nomi·诺米 Rive production scene

All artwork in the production scene is derived from the user-supplied full-body mother (source-nomi-master.png):
every layer is cut from its pixels, and the areas the mother hides are painted procedurally from the same part's own
pixels (tools/rebuild). No AI-generated or third-party pixels are added. See parts/DETAIL_LICENSE.json for per-file
hashes and provenance.
